---
import Layout from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Underline from "../components/Underline.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../consts";
---

<Layout title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
  <h1>I'm Jean-Philippe</h1>
  <p>
    Hybrid web developer & designer, specialized in UI and front-end
    development, experienced with the whole stack. My current tools of choice
    are React on TypeScript, and more recently .NET/C#.
  </p>
  <p>
    Outside of work, I’m into sports photography, traveling, music & concerts,
    and currently learning <Underline>simracing</Underline>.
  </p>

  <h2>What's new?</h2>
  <p>
    I’m currently semi-nomad working traveling the world, while building an
    application to find cool coffee shops near you. Also slowly attempting to
    learn Russian.
  </p>
</Layout>
